The <participant id="c" label="Client"/>client opens with a <participant id="s" label="Server"/><message from="c" to="s" label="SYN"/>SYN, the server <message from="s" to="c" label="SYN-ACK" style="return"/>answers, and the client <message from="c" to="s" label="ACK"/>acknowledges. It may <message from="s" to="s" label="retry"/>retry on its own, and a broken <message from="c" label="FIN"/>close is dropped.
An array <cells id="arr" values="3|1||4" count="6" label="nums"/>holds six slots. We <write target="arr.2" text="7"/>store seven in slot two, then <annotate target="arr.3" mark="highlight" fill="mint" text="i"/>look at slot three and <strike target="arr.0" text="9"/>replace the first.
Buckets <cells id="ht" count="4" vertical="true" index="none" label="buckets"/>sit in a column, and <node id="k1" label="apple: 3" near="ht.2" dir="right"/><edge from="ht.2" to="k1"/>apple lands in bucket two. <cells id="blk" values="A|B" index="0x10|0x14"/>Pages have addresses, and <cells id="bad"/>this one is dropped.
A tree <node id="n5" label="5" kind="circle"/>starts at five, <node id="n3" label="3" parent="n5" side="left"/>three goes left, <node id="n8" label="8" parent="n5" side="right"/>eight goes right, and <node id="n1" label="1" parent="n3" side="L"/>one under three.
See `internal/net/tcp.go:88-95`, and handler.go:L12. The port is localhost:8080 at 12:30.
